---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="The Dojo | About Shinobi SEO"
  description="Meet the ranking warriors behind Shinobi SEO. Proven science combined with creative strategy to help ambitious brands rise through the ranks."
>
  <section class="py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="font-bangers text-5xl md:text-6xl text-center mb-8">
        Welcome to the <span class="text-anime-cyan">Dojo</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-16">
        <p>
          Founded by ranking warriors who have battled across thousands of SERPs,
          Shinobi SEO blends proven SEO science with creative strategy. Our mission
          is to help ambitious brands rise through the ranks with speed, precision,
          and unstoppable momentum.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not believe in one-size-fits-all tactics or empty promises. Every
          client quest is unique. We train your site with the exact techniques it
          needs — whether that is Code Ninjutsu for technical health, Alliance
          Forging for authority, or Story Arc Mastery for content that ranks and
          converts.
        </p>
        <p>
          At Shinobi SEO we treat ranking as a true craft. Continuous training,
          transparent reporting, and a relentless focus on results define how we
          work with every partner.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-anime-panel border-4 border-black rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-[5px_5px_0_#FF2D55]">
          <div class="font-bangers text-4xl text-anime-pink mb-1">500+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Ranking Victories</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-anime-panel border-4 border-black rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-[5px_5px_0_#00F5FF]">
          <div class="font-bangers text-4xl text-anime-cyan mb-1">+210%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Avg Organic Growth</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-anime-panel border-4 border-black rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-[5px_5px_0_#FFE600]">
          <div class="font-bangers text-4xl text-anime-yellow mb-1">98%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Client Retention</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-anime-panel border-4 border-black rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-[5px_5px_0_#7C3AED]">
          <div class="font-bangers text-4xl text-anime-purple mb-1">24/7</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Ranking Watch</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-block px-10 py-5 bg-anime-pink text-white font-bangers text-2xl rounded-xl border-4 border-black shadow-[6px_6px_0_#00F5FF] hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0_#00F5FF] hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 transition-all"
        >
          Join the Dojo
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
